+  %selector = call i32 (i8*, i8*, ...)* @llvm.eh.selector(i8* %exc1, i8* bitcast (i32 (...)* @__gxx_personality_v0 to i8*), i8* bitcast (i8** @_ZTIi to i8*), i8* null) ; <i32> [#uses=1]
